{"id":"vod_sn_37213","vodId":"37213","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"八犬传：东方八犬异闻","name_cn":"八犬传：东方八犬异闻","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/003900ce2663b601e3618c16046d1433.jpg"},"summary":"5年前，一场不知原因的疫病在村庄中发生，为了防止蔓延到其它村，别村村民将大冢村全部烧毁殆尽。犬冢信乃（柿原彻也 配音）、犬川荘介（日野聪 配音）、浜路（高垣彩阳 配音）在这次事件中得到了教会的保护，因而得以幸存。在这次事件后，信乃与荘介意外得到了特殊的能力。听到二人能力传闻的教会为了找到两人把浜路拐走。为了拯救浜路而前往首都的信乃与荘介与犬神附体者相遇，而这次邂逅开启了一段段奇幻、冒险的浪漫谭。　　本片改编自阿部美幸老师的同名漫画，漫画目前尚未完结。老师的代表作还有《微忧青春日记》、《SUPER LOVERS》等。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qhiwanungY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TyntDvUnww1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4rVy8YeqGm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yxe0E48s8h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FhkC6BZw7T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uKwgtKb9HF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qQFdqA2fvj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CAqN0Xr2Ln1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fKLCWb3WUW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Cfn9wKu5EZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ak4FmNNdFL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ubF08mcPW61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rUTZv5gC4d1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:13.576Z"}